    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "MUTATING operation. Verify target and authorized intent; reconcile outcome before retry. Delete an income by id.\n\nDeleting an income also removes its related accounting journal and attachments.\n\nAn income cannot be deleted while it is linked to another record (e.g. generated from another entity), already used in an income-distribution transaction, or dated in a closed financial period.\n\n**Access:** requires the account owner, or staff with *Edit/Delete All Incomes* or *Edit/Delete His Own Incomes* (for their own records).",
